DESCRIPTION:HizashiCon is an anime and Japanese pop-culture convention put
  on by the Japan-America Society of Northwest Florida as part of Foo Foo 
 Festival\, from October 30 to November 1 in Pensacola. The program includ
 es cosplay contests\, panels with voice actors\, video game tournaments\,
  artist alley\, a vendor hall\, live music and an Idol Fest. A Giant Robo
 t documentary screening and a Cat-puccinos and Cosplay brunch at Coastal 
 Cat Cafe are also scheduled.\nPrice: from $18.36\nArea: Pensacola\nTimes:
